{"document_id":"policy_001","title":"工伤保险条例","article":"第十四条第（六）项","province":"全国","city":"","keywords":["上下班途中","交通事故","非本人主要责任","工伤认定"],"content":"职工在上下班途中，受到非本人主要责任的交通事故或者城市轨道交通、客运轮渡、火车事故伤害的，应当认定为工伤。","tenant":"default","effective_from":"2011-01-01","effective_to":null,"review_status":"approved","audience_roles":["public","agent"],"source_type":"official","document_version":"国务院令第586号","source_url":"https://www.moj.gov.cn/pub/sfbgw/zcjd/201012/t20101224_389943.html","corpus_version":"policy-corpus.v1"}
{"document_id":"policy_002","title":"工伤职工劳动能力鉴定管理办法","article":"第八条","province":"全国","city":"","keywords":["劳动能力鉴定","材料","伤残等级","诊断证明","病历材料","身份证明"],"content":"申请劳动能力鉴定应当填写劳动能力鉴定申请表，并提交工伤认定决定书、有效的诊断证明、完整病历材料以及工伤职工的居民身份证或者社会保障卡等有效身份证明。","tenant":"default","effective_from":"2015-04-02","effective_to":null,"review_status":"approved","audience_roles":["public","agent"],"source_type":"official","document_version":"人力资源社会保障部令第21号","source_url":"https://www.moj.gov.cn/pub/sfbgw/flfggz/flfggzbmgz/201503/t20150306_145510.html","corpus_version":"policy-corpus.v1"}
{"document_id":"policy_003","title":"四川省工伤保险条例实施办法","article":"待遇章节","province":"四川省","city":"","keywords":["十级","待遇","一次性伤残补助金","工伤医疗补助金","伤残就业补助金"],"content":"《实施办法》明确了一次性工伤医疗补助金和一次性伤残就业补助金的具体标准，并细化了五级至十级工伤职工在特定情形下的待遇和经办事项。","tenant":"default","effective_from":"2021-09-01","effective_to":null,"review_status":"approved","audience_roles":["public","agent"],"source_type":"official","document_version":"川府发〔2021〕10号","source_url":"https://www.sc.gov.cn/10462/zfwjts/2021/7/6/de4cec5b6bb5469e9e0454f4d3ba4ac2.shtml","corpus_version":"policy-corpus.v1"}
{"document_id":"policy_004","title":"工伤保险条例","article":"第三十七条第（一）项","province":"全国","city":"","keywords":["十级","一次性伤残补助金","本人工资","七个月"],"content":"职工因工致残被鉴定为七级至十级伤残的，从工伤保险基金按伤残等级支付一次性伤残补助金；十级伤残标准为七个月的本人工资。","tenant":"default","effective_from":"2011-01-01","effective_to":null,"review_status":"approved","audience_roles":["public","agent"],"source_type":"official","document_version":"国务院令第586号","source_url":"https://www.moj.gov.cn/pub/sfbgw/zcjd/201012/t20101224_389943.html","corpus_version":"policy-corpus.v1"}
